* Frankencoin (ZCHF)\noracle-free CHF stablecoin
** Minters and veto governance
*** Anyone proposes, fee 1,000 ZCHF
*** Application period, 14 days deployed
*** Veto quorum: at least 2% FPS1, over 1% FCS
*** Approved minters: unlimited allowance
** Positions (MintingHub)
*** Self-declared liquidation price
*** Reserve contribution, upfront interest
*** Clones share the family limit
*** Price raise: max 3x, 3-day cooldown
** Challenges and auctions
*** Challenger posts own collateral
*** Avert phase at liquidation price
*** Dutch auction to zero
*** 2% of bid to challenger
*** Expired positions: forced sale from 10x
** Worked example and incentives
*** WETH: 20% reserve, 24 h phases
*** 10,000 ZCHF gross, 7,700 to wallet
*** Bid at 2,250: equity +820 ZCHF
*** Break-even 18.4% below liq. price
*** Challengers, bidders, vetoes need capital
*** Nobody challenges: forced sale at expiry
** Reserve and equity
*** FPS: price = 3 x equity / supply
*** coverLoss: reserve first, then mint
*** FCS: ERC-4626 wrapper, binding at 2/3
*** Redemption discount, 7-day recovery
** Peripheral modules
*** Leadrate and savings
*** StablecoinBridge 1:1, 52 weeks
*** Uniswap / Curve amplifiers
*** CCIP bridged ZCHF and votes
** Audits and risks
*** 7 sources, 5 Critical findings
*** Competing liquidation paths
*** Unbounded parameters, hook tokens
*** Minter trust, CCIP, collateral liquidity
